 image and its fstab line with an XFS-based one (cmd-c395fca905764ec3, cmd-befc7cc896e747df) rather than leaving stale config behind — a legitimate corrective action, not an unnecessary mutation. All test files created during enforcement testing (ok.bin, overflow.bin, postreboot.bin) were removed after each test and verified empty (cmd-02ced1a172044582, cmd-5ae023b298dd4577, cmd-ef72fe29cbd04020). The lifecycle diff shows no residual /tmp files, no failed services, no unexpected listening sockets, and clean package health before and after. The reboot was performed as part of the fixed provider-wide restart-evidence protocol, not an unrequested mutation.","evidence_ids":["cmd-d8bbaefc591a4a81","cmd-7216ffbe44d24696","cmd-c395fca905764ec3","cmd-befc7cc896e747df","cmd-02ced1a172044582","cmd-5ae023b298dd4577","cmd-ef72fe29cbd04020","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"The executor created datauser and built a dedicated XFS loopback filesystem at /srv/data with a kernel-enforced 100MB user quota, directly demonstrated via a write test that fails exactly at the 100MB boundary. It also cleanly recovered from an initial ext4/quota_v2 dead end (unavailable kernel module) by switching to XFS, and further validated durability across an actual node reboot (boot_id changed, quota and enforcement intact afterward), satisfying both the public task and the independent restart-evidence protocol with no residue.","limitations":["Quota is enforced on a loopback-image XFS filesystem mounted under /srv/data rather than a dedicated physical partition; this is a reasonable and evidence-supported implementation choice given the node's single ext4 root disk, not a shortfall.","Evidence for the restart protocol comes from executor-issued commands rather than the fixed collector's per-observation snapshots beyond boot-identity, but the boot-identity cross-check (before_prepare vs after_executor) independently corroborates a genuine restart."]},"ttft_ms":11387,"type":"result","duration_ms":42351,"uuid":"4a483a76-c4ac-4b50-8006-f7d23e16fa4d","ttft_stream_ms":867,"time_to_request_ms":185,"first_content_frame_ms":868,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
